<doc id="100219" url="https://su.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=100219" title="Astrid Kirchherr">
Astrid Kirchherr

<ol>
<li>ALIH</<li>
</ol>
Astrid Kirchherr (gumelar 20 1938 – tilar dunya 12 2020 dina umur 81 taun) mangrupi fotografer sareng seniman Jerman anu kawéntar pikeun pakaitna sareng &lt;a href="The%20Beatles"&gt;Beatles&lt;/a&gt; (bareng sareng réréncangan na &lt;a href="Klaus%20Voormann"&gt;Klaus Voormann&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="J%C3%BCrgen%20Vollmer"&gt;Jürgen Vollmer&lt;/a&gt;) sareng foto dirina tina anggota aslina band – &lt;a href="John%20Lennon"&gt;John Lennon&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Paul%20McCartney"&gt;Paul McCartney&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="George%20Harrison"&gt;George Harrison&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Stuart%20Sutcliffe"&gt;Stuart Sutcliffe&lt;/a&gt; jeung &lt;a href="Pete%20Best"&gt;Pete Best&lt;/a&gt;. 
Kirchherr patepang seniman &lt;a href="Stuart%20Sutcliffe"&gt;Stuart Sutcliffe&lt;/a&gt; di bar Kaiserkeller di &lt;a href="Hamburg"&gt;Hamburg&lt;/a&gt; taun 1960, di mana Sutcliffe maénkeun bass sareng Beatles, sareng teras dilaksanakeun anjeunna, sateuacan pupus anjeunna taun 1962. Sanajan Kirchherr nembak pisan sababaraha gambar saatos taun 1967, karya awal tos dipamerkeun di Hamburg, &lt;a href="Bremen"&gt;Bremen&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="London"&gt;London&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Liverpool"&gt;Liverpool&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="New%20York%20City"&gt;New York City&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Washington%2C%20D.C."&gt;Washington, D.C.&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Tokyo"&gt;Tokyo&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Vienna"&gt;Vienna&lt;/a&gt;. Anjeunna nyebarkeun tilu buku édisi terbatas.
