The Theory of Everything mangrupa pilem biografi drama Inggris 2014 diarahkeun ku &lt;a href="James%20Marsh"&gt;James Marsh&lt;/a&gt; sareng dikaluarkeun ku &lt;a href="Tim%20Bevan"&gt;Tim Bevan&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Eric%20Fellner"&gt;Eric Fellner&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Lisa%20Bruce"&gt;Lisa Bruce&lt;/a&gt; sareng &lt;a href="Anthony%20McCarten"&gt;Anthony McCarten&lt;/a&gt;. Skrip pilem ieu ditulis ku Anthony McCarten dumasar kana buku éta Travelling to Infinity: My Life with Stephen ku &lt;a href="Jane%20Wilde%20Hawking"&gt;Jane Wilde Hawking&lt;/a&gt;. Pilem ieu dimaénkeun ku &lt;a href="Eddie%20Redmayne"&gt;Eddie Redmayne&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Felicity%20Jones"&gt;Felicity Jones&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Charlie%20Cox"&gt;Charlie Cox&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="David%20Thewlis"&gt;David Thewlis&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Emily%20Watson"&gt;Emily Watson&lt;/a&gt; dan &lt;a href="Simon%20McBurney"&gt;Simon McBurney&lt;/a&gt;.
