<li>Novelnya, Negarabatin (&lt;a href="2016"&gt;2016&lt;/a&gt;) meraih &lt;a href="Hadiah%20Sastra%20Rancag%C3%A9"&gt;Hadiah Sastra Rancagé&lt;/a&gt; &lt;a href="2017"&gt;2017&lt;/a&gt;</li>
